## 📝 Changelog

### v1.12.3 (April 2026)
- **Agent latency pack** - Anthropic / Bedrock Claude prompt caching toggle (opt-in per agent; cuts TTFT and per-call cost on stable prompts), Flux endpointing delay fix (Response Delay no longer stacks on top of Flux's own EOT timeout), Agent Warm Idle worker (first call of the day 2-5s faster; toggle in Settings → System)
- **MCP auto-versioning** - API-initiated prompt edits now create a prompt-history entry tagged `source=mcp` with the API key name recorded, so browser edits and programmatic edits share the same audit trail and one-click rollback
- **MCP expanded coverage** - External Claude / Cursor / Claude Desktop clients can now read and write every agent configuration field (realtime, outbound detection, LLM fallback, voice fine-tuning, conversation dynamics, KB assignments, Azure deployments, etc.) — previously limited to a small subset
