  - Italian, Dutch, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian
  - Japanese, Korean, Chinese (Mandarin + Taiwan), Hindi, Thai, Vietnamese, Indonesian, Malay, Filipino
  - Arabic, Turkish, Swedish, Danish, Norwegian, Finnish
  - ElevenLabs Scribe auto-detects 90+ languages (no configuration needed)
- **Multi-Language TTS Support** - Language-filtered voice selection for Google TTS and Deepgram:
  - TTS language dropdown filters available voices by language
  - Google TTS: Chirp 3 HD voices for 20+ languages
  - Deepgram Aura: Multilingual voices (Thalia, Apollo, Asteria, Orion) for 18 languages
  - Custom voice ID field for non-listed languages/voices

### v1.1.3 (January 2026)
- **Granular Permission Enforcement** - Complete permission system overhaul:
  - Settings routes now use granular `view`/`edit` permission checks instead of just admin authentication
  - Rooms page: Create and Delete buttons only visible to users with corresponding permissions
  - Egress page: Manual Recording, Stop, and Delete buttons respect user permissions
  - Bulk delete checkboxes hidden for users without delete permission
  - Consistent permission enforcement at both route and UI levels
- **xAI/Grok LLM Provider** - Added xAI support using OpenAI-compatible SDK:
  - 6 Grok models including grok-3, grok-3-fast, grok-2-latest
  - Uses `openai.LLM.with_x_ai()` method for integration
  - XAI_API_KEY configuration in Settings → Integrations
- **Knowledge Base Page** - New placeholder page for upcoming RAG capabilities
- **LiveKit Plugins Section** - Dependencies tab now shows all LiveKit plugins with version detection
- **Collect DTMF Tool** - New tool for collecting keypad input from callers:
  - Uses LiveKit's `GetDtmfTask` for reliable DTMF detection
  - Supports both keypad tones and spoken digits
  - Configurable: number of digits, timeout, terminator key (#/*)
  - Optional confirmation readback
  - Mask option for sensitive data (PINs)
- **Blind Transfer Tool** - Direct call transfer without consultation:
  - Transfers caller to external phone number via SIP REFER
  - Configurable transfer destinations with friendly names
  - Optional dial tone playback during transfer
- **Attended Transfer Tool** - Warm consultation transfer:
  - Places caller on hold with optional hold music
  - Agent consults with destination before completing transfer
  - Actions: initiate, complete, cancel
  - Configurable consultation timeout
- **Agent Handoff Improvements**:
  - Sign-off prompt: Agent speaks custom message before transfer
  - Silent transfer: Skip "I'm transferring you" announcement
  - Context modes: Full (complete history), Summary, Fresh (clean slate)
  - Secondary agent greeting: Automatic greeting after receiving handoff
- **Communication Tools Fixes**:
  - SendSMS: Added token auth, fixed JSON escaping, phone validation
  - SendEmail: Fixed email regex, SMTP TLS handling, async SES with aioboto3
- **Turn Detection** - Now using MultilingualModel v0.4.1-intl:
  - 39% reduction in false-positive interruptions
  - 14 language support including English, Spanish, Chinese, Japanese
  - Transformer-based with prosody and semantic understanding

### v1.1.2 (January 2026)
- **Agent Knowledge Base** - New field in agent configuration for factual information:
  - Add business hours, address, contact details, policies
  - Automatically included in the agent's system prompt under "## Knowledge Base"
  - Positioned between System Prompt and Tool Usage Instructions
- **Working Hold Music** - Hold tool now actually plays hold music during calls:
  - Uses LiveKit's BackgroundAudioPlayer for audio playback
  - Plays uploaded hold music file when caller is placed on hold
  - Automatically stops when call is resumed
- **Play Audio Tool** - Now fully functional with file upload:
  - Upload audio files (MP3, WAV, OGG) for disclaimers, announcements
  - Select default audio file in configuration
  - Plays audio to caller using BackgroundAudioPlayer
- **Audio File Upload for Tools** - Upload custom audio files directly in tool configuration modals:
  - **Hold Music Upload** - Upload hold music in the Hold tool configuration
  - **Play Audio Upload** - Upload audio files for disclaimers/announcements in the Play Audio tool
  - Support for MP3, WAV, OGG audio formats (max 10MB)
  - In-modal audio preview and management
  - Recommended format: Mono, 16-bit, 16kHz or 8kHz for telephony
- **Tool Calls in Transcription** - Tool usage now appears inline in Call Detail transcriptions:
  - Purple-styled segments showing tool name, arguments, and results
  - Includes hangup, transfer, get_datetime, and all other tools
  - Pre-logging for call-ending tools ensures they appear even when call ends
- **Hangup Tool Improvements** - Now properly ends SIP calls:
  - Uses LiveKit API to remove all participants from the room
  - Ensures both agent and caller are disconnected properly
- **GetDateTime Human-Readable Formats** - Configuration now uses dropdown menus with human-readable format options:
  - Date formats like "Tuesday, 14 January 2025" instead of Python strftime codes
  - Time formats like "2:30 PM" or "14:30"
- **Tool Configuration Fixes** - Fixed show_when conditions for checkbox fields (e.g., Hold Music File dropdown)
- **Eager EOT Checkbox Fix** - Fixed checkbox persistence issue after save

### v1.1.1 (January 2026)
- **Comprehensive Latency Monitoring** - Full round-trip latency tracking for voice AI pipeline:
  - Component-level breakdown: STT, LLM (TTFT), TTS latency measured separately
  - Percentile tracking: P50/P90/P99 metrics with color-coded thresholds
  - Latency Metrics card on Call History page with Chart.js visualizations
  - Per-agent latency comparison table
  - Visual component bar on Call Details page showing STT/LLM/TTS proportions
  - Live TTFB column in Rooms page with 5-second auto-refresh
  - Slow call detection with >1000ms warning
- **Real-Time Metrics Service** - Redis-based live metrics for active calls
- **New API Endpoints**:
  - GET /api/call-history/latency-stats - Aggregated latency analytics
  - GET /api/rooms/active-metrics - Live metrics for all active calls
  - GET /api/rooms/{room_name}/metrics - Live metrics for specific call

### v1.1.0 (January 2026)
