### v1.0.14 (January 2026)
- **Customer Access** - New permission template for multi-tenant access with agent-based data filtering:
  - Assign multiple agents to customer users
  - Overview analytics filtered to assigned agents only
  - Call History shows only assigned agents' calls
  - Agents list restricted to assigned agents
  - Recordings filtered via call linkage to assigned agents
  - Navigation automatically hides inaccessible pages
- **Expanded Analytics** - New Calls and Agents tabs in Overview with charts for call volume, outcomes, direction, hourly distribution, and per-agent performance
- **Custom Data Extraction** - Define per-agent fields to extract from transcriptions during AI summary generation
- **AI Call Summaries** - Auto-generate summaries using OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google LLMs with conversation analysis
- **Call History** - Complete call tracking with transcriptions, TTFB metrics, filtering, and CSV/JSON export
- **Tool Registry** - Auto-discovery system for agent tools with built-in hangup, transfer, and hold tools
- **Enhanced Webhook Tools** - Custom HTTP integrations for n8n, make.com, Zapier with:
  - Response handling: JSONPath extraction, success conditions, error message paths
  - Error handling: speak-on-error, speak-on-delay with threshold
  - Retry logic: configurable count, delay, and status codes
  - Rate limiting: per-minute and per-session limits
  - Authentication: bearer, basic, API key (header/query)
  - Availability: condition expressions and hours of operation
  - Mock mode: testing without real HTTP calls
  - Execution logging: track all webhook calls
- **New Built-in Tools**:
  - Communication: SendSMS (HTTP API), SendEmail (SMTP/SES)
  - Utility: GetDateTime, ScheduleCallback, RecordNote, LookupCaller
- **External Event Injection API** - Inject events into active calls from external systems:
  - POST /api/calls/inject - Generic event injection
  - Supported events: speak, end_call, transfer, send_dtmf, set_context
  - API key authentication with expiration
  - Shorthand endpoints: /api/calls/{room}/speak, /end, /transfer, /context
  - GET /api/calls/active - List active calls
  - Real-time event processing via Redis PubSub
  - AgentEventListener with session registration/unregistration
- **Global Tool Configuration** - Configure built-in tools with API URLs, credentials, and settings
- **Multi-Agent Dispatch** - Route different phone numbers to different agents via dispatch rule metadata
- **System Resources Monitoring** - Monitor all services, restart from UI, edit memory/CPU limits
- **Recording Retention** - Configurable automatic cleanup of old local recordings (1-365 days)
- **Cloud Storage for Call History** - Optional S3/GCS backup for call records
- Fixed livekit-agents v1.3 API migration (FunctionContext → ToolContext)
- Fixed agent OOM crash (increased memory limit to 768MB)
- Fixed transcription duplicates in call history
- Security: Updated aiohttp to 3.13.3 (CVE-2025-69223, CVE-2025-69226, CVE-2025-69228)
- **Contextual Help System** - Page-specific (?) help button with field explanations for all pages
- **Agent Export/Import v2.0** - Now includes handoff configurations and tool assignments
- **Enhanced Permission Templates** - Fixed Quick Set buttons with complete page/action coverage

